# question: I am reviewing the oxygen usage logs for all patients with blood cancer in our system. We need to see the individual records listed one by one with their date and time instead of just aggregates. Could you please pull that detailed list for me?
# expected_compliant: false
# expected_rules: not_aggregated
# origin: train
# notes: SELECT ?when WHERE { GRAPH ?g { ?r a sphn:InhaledOxygenConcentration . ?r sphn:hasDateTime ?when . } } ORDER BY ?when
PREFIX sphn: <https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-schema/sphn#>
SELECT ?when WHERE { GRAPH ?g { ?r a sphn:InhaledOxygenConcentration . ?r sphn:hasDateTime ?when . } } ORDER BY ?when
